						<r3d:remarks>4TU.ResearchData is covered by Clarivate Data Citation Index. 
All metadata are provided under CC0 License. 
From 27 May 2016, Wageningen University &amp; Research Centre joined the partnership of the three universities of technology in the Netherlands (3TU.Federation). From this date the partnership is known as 4TU and the cooperation on education and research was extended further. 4TU.ResearchData was an initiative of the libraries of the three Dutch Technical Universities (TU Delft, TU Eindhoven and University of Twente).
All data sets stored in 4TU.ResearchData are accessible via the Netherlands Research Portal on OpenAIRE CONNECT. Netherlands Research Portal is the gateway to scholarly information in The Netherlands. The link between Netherlands Research Portal and 4TU.ResearchData ensures that the research datasets may now be more easily found.</r3d:remarks>
